## Exp:6. Policy Compliance Agent
Build an agent with rule-based evaluation and synthetic data
## Objective
To build a Policy Compliance Agent that evaluates synthetic employee data against predefined policy rules and determines whether each employee is COMPLIANT or NON-COMPLIANT.
## Policy Rules
The system evaluates employees using the following rules:
•	Password Length :The password must contain at least 8 characters. 
•	Multi-Factor: Multi-factor authentication (MFA) must be enabled. 
•	Admin :Admin access is allowed only for employees belonging to the IT department.
